   "value": "<p><strong>Upgrade DV:</strong> DV 21<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> Cost #1: Cost of Popup weapon being upgraded\n\nCost #2: 500eb<br>\n<strong>Thermometer:</strong> Reduces the option slot cost of Popup weapon cyberware.<br>\n<strong>Applies To:</strong> Any \"Popup\" weapon cyberarm cyberware<br>\n<strong>Vendor:</strong> Toaster</p>\n<p>\"Jammin' that thing into an arm is a fuckin' miracle.\"</p>\n<p>Lowers the Cyberarm Option Slots required for this Popup Weapon Cyberware by 1 (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Price is Cost #2 only; Cost #1 is the cost of the Popup weapon.</li>\n<li>Lower the Popup weapon's size (its Option Slots) by 1 by hand, minimum 1.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Invented Tech Upgrades).</em></p>"
